=== PRODUCT POSITIONING & WEBSITE COMMENTARY ===
Product Focus: Plain White T-Shirt. 
My project centers on a minimalist, developer-focused plain white T-shirt e-commerce site. The choice to focus exclusively on a simple white t-shirt is deliberate: it strips away the noise of complex apparel variations, flashy graphics, and unsupported fabric quality claims. This allows the core architecture of the website—structured via modular HTML, clean CSS (`styles.css`), and dynamic JavaScript (`styleguide.js`)—to take center stage. 

Commentary on the Site Architecture:
- **Design System & Styleguide:** The repository implements a unified style guide (`styleguide.html` and `styleguide.js`) to maintain consistent typography, color palettes (emphasizing clean monochrome tones matching the white t-shirt aesthetic), and component layouts.
- **Frontend Interfacing:** The site utilizes vanilla JavaScript and structured DOM manipulation to handle user interaction dynamically without relying on bloated frameworks, keeping the codebase lightweight, fast, and easy to audit.
- **Minimalist Branding:** By anchoring the store around a single, high-clarity item (the white t-shirt), the user experience remains focused entirely on frictionless navigation, clean product presentation, and robust frontend design principles.

